htf_fvg_show = input.bool(true, 'Pane FVG', inline = 'htffvg', group = gHTFSetings, tooltip = 'FVG on the HTF1 / HTF2 pane candles (GG rules). Bullish: low of the 3rd candle above the high of the 1st; bearish: high of the 3rd below the low of the 1st. Only once the 3rd candle has closed (no repaint), consecutive candles only (no gap over a session break). Box over the three candles (left edge of the 1st to right edge of the 3rd), between the 1st and 3rd candle, behind the candles. Pane only.')
