key_levels_show = input.bool(true, 'Key Levels', inline = 'KL', group = gHTFSetings, tooltip = 'Mark II aa (from Mark I). Highest high (-TF) and lowest low (+TF) of the candles in the highest shown pane (HTF2 when it is shown and higher than HTF1, otherwise HTF1), running candle included. Chart: from the bar of that high / low to 10 bars past the last bar, label = pane timeframe. Replaces Pairing Range (2D).')
